# CVE exceptions for the Trivy release gate in cd-release.yml.
#
# The gate blocks releases on *fixable* CRITICAL/HIGH findings in the
# container image. If a finding must be waived deliberately (e.g. a
# false positive, or a vulnerability that provably doesn't apply to
# this image), add its ID below with a justification comment and
# revisit it on the next release.
#
# Format — justification comment above, one vulnerability ID per line:
#
# # zlib finding is a false positive for the trixie package (2026-07-18)
# CVE-2026-12345
